        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWpFM15FuA_LALpD09xK7nYadHBm-Ee03peZ8W5P4MqHv80dOleGQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "First time at this garage.\nBrought my audi for an alignment.\nVery friendly staff and they even explain the work they do on your vehicle and they give you a detailed invoice on the work done.\nAbsolutely proffesional staff and clean environment.\nLooks like I found my new trusting garage finally that will be my spot now.\n\nExcellent honest work and they dont fleece you for money !!!!",
        "time": 1750973741,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chris A",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103895011880451280591/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIBDZY5SWceG_5KdnjIjfTVlZMY3Nr62vg0gGxV3wPzecB0eQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Went only for an alignment.\nMy appointment time was respect which I really appreciated.\nGreat experience for my first visit. Clean and professional staff. Took the time to explain the work that was done.\nWill definitely go back for other mechanical needs.",
        "time": 1748473113,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marco Tiberio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104226214688534023437/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKWnL9fh1nKOnPtOLPcshXVQ8jOWNmhJAdXfXsoAlv1tN1L2w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Had an appointment at 8, staff arrived and greeted me early which allowed me to arrive to work on time. They called me to let me know when my vehicle was ready. Service was quick and easy, pricing was fair. Would definately come back 5/5",
        "time": 1664908356,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "christina tammaro",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107771908829676304070/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWrXdzP_PNueU2yZV-Ck9k-kjz7Nd4EgeQyRBMBMyFfngD20wzD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 years ago",
        "text": "I started coming to service my car at this garage because I had a coupon and I haven't been to another garage since! The service is exceptional and timely and the staff are very nice. During my most recent visit, I had to replace a defective gas line on my vehicle and they repaired it at no charge. Overall excellent customer service and vehicle expertise.",
        "time": 1484077870,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Benoit Villemure-Marcotte",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105952675445201253846/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTRF93dHv8XXaUjP8Zx1qGE7UqUTe0vxHDd3h6uuiYtvqnBg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Good customer service, really good vibes in this place. It is by far the best customer experience I had in a garage. Price wise they were about 30% less expensive than the 2 others I called and made the repairs the same day I called in a span of 3 hours. Impressed",
        "time": 1496952823,
